{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐呐，安洁！听说你要做一个很厉害的蛋糕是真的吗？”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "sc0040", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁要做一个巨大的圣诞蛋糕，听起来好棒啊～”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "jb0033", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么？借了教室去做吗？全校份的蛋糕太厉害了吧？”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "da0049", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呃，蛋糕的事情好像传遍校园了呢。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天从早上开始，就一直有人来询问。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每个看到安洁的人都问她关于蛋糕的事。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我的班上也在讨论这件事。”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sk1018", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，３年级的班上也讨论得很热烈喔。小菜夏的巨大蛋糕，很厉害的感觉。”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "mu0434", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“已经是全校等级的话题了呢。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2608", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到来玩的其他年级的两人这么说，安洁一脸认真地点着头。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这下子责任重大了。”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4112", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过蛋糕本来就是要送给全校，现在的情况也是我想看见的。”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对语气调侃的濑名同学，我勾起嘴角回应。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，虽然变得完全没有惊喜感了。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2609", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过您说的没错，主人。安洁又更鼓起干劲了！”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2610", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错，大家的期待对我们来说是很感激的事。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想要回应大家的期待，这个念头让我们斗志高昂。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人，安洁会努力的！”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2611", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，今天也一起加油吧安洁。”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔！没有问题！”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2612", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是，我们就这样燃起了干劲。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以？今天放学后也要去料理实习室吗？”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "ht0379", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，因为还没决定要做怎么样的蛋糕。”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要决定这个还挺困难的呢。”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2613", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～这也是有趣的地方不是吗？我也去偷看一下好了。”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "ht0380", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也去。”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sk1019", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，遵命。那安洁等你们过来喔！”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2614", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样，时间来到了放学。因为学期也快要结束了，所以从今天开始都只有半天课。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟安洁斗志高昂地走向料理实习室──", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“比起蛋糕本体，装饰的部分似乎会花掉更多时间呢。”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2615", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯，不过多一点装饰的蛋糕适合庆祝，感觉很棒呢。”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，就像在蛋糕上放用巧克力做的圣诞老人的感觉。塑形巧克力装饰艺术就是这样。”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2616", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，那我们就先做出蛋糕本体，剩余的时间就全部拿来做装饰怎么样？”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～不过既然要做，安洁想做生奶油蛋糕呢……”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2617", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“生奶油没办法久放对吗？”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，所以要在前一晚决胜负。”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2618", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样的话，就必须把除此之外可以事前准备的工作都做完成……”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有订购材料之类的事要做呢。其实时间有点急迫，不过这也让安洁斗志高昂就是了！”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2619", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，也让我试吃蛋糕～”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "sc0041", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太学长，又一个人来了。”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sk1020", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好～请在墙壁这边排队喔～现在蛋糕制作小组正在讨论～”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "ht0381", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯～”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈哈……”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2620", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁要制作巨大蛋糕”的消息已经传遍全校，大家都很感兴趣的样子。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从我们走进料理实习室之后，人潮就像这样一波波涌来。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的很抱歉。隼太、樱乃，谢谢你们。”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“反正这样也挺有趣的，没关系。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "ht0382", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以什么时候要做试吃蛋糕？”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sk1021", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为大方向已经决定了，本来今天不打算做试吃蛋糕的，不过……啊哈哈哈。”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2621", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "带着期待聚集在这里的人人人们。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果说出今天没有试吃的话好像会引发暴动……", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……其实我们刚才还谈到时间方面很急迫……”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们在旁边也听到了。好像有很多事要做所以时间不太够吧？”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "ja0068", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯。”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社员A", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ra0003", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了一般来参观（？）的学生之外，料理研的人今天也和我们一起使用料理实习室。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……应该说，她们已经聚过来听我们讨论了。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为昨天的试吃，所以又更兴致高昂了吧。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不久之后。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么办呢，安洁？”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天干脆就先满足大家……”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2622", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然接下来的准备会很辛苦，不过目前的状况也必须解决……", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，我们也想帮忙！不是只站在一边试吃而已喔！”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "ja0069", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……？”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2623", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到意料之外的话，我们睁大了眼睛。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“反正我们暂时要一起使用这间教室，而且好像挺有趣的。”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "ja0070", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“巨无霸圣诞蛋糕好梦幻喔～嗯嗯，我们也想做呢！”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社员B", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": "rb0003", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，安洁！让我们帮忙吧！！”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "ja0071", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "料理研的人异口同声地说，其他学生们一听也兴致高昂地谈论了起来。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像变得很盛大呢。”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对啊，就像文化祭一样！”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "jc0061", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，我也来帮忙！就像料理实习课那样一起做！”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "sc0042", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后，开始有这样的声音。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一旦有人开头，大家就纷纷响应。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想要帮忙、让我帮忙……", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但、但是，各位……”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2624", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样很好欸！虽然没办法像安洁以前做的那样帮忙做学校的工作。”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "sc0043", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这种小事的话，就可以跟安洁一起做了。”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "jc0062", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哇……哇……”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2625", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁跟我面面相觑。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为是想送给大家的礼物，所以原本打算只有我们自己做的……", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在各位的协助之下，完成的送给各位的东西，感觉也很棒呢……”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2626", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……是啊，连这部分都有分享的感觉……”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，我又再次体认到了。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁的人气。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然她以前一直是野生女仆……", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过还是被学校的所有人亲近、喜爱，“大家的女仆”就是这么回事。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈……”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2627", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人，这样可以吧？”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2628", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，照安洁想做的做吧。”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢您♪”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2629", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她开心地对我露出微笑──", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后很快地转身面对众人。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么各位，和安洁一起来做蛋糕吧～～～～！！”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2630", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……原来如此，这就是骚动的原因啊。”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4113", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "来料理实习室看看情况的濑名同学叹了一口气。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然很意外演变成跟大家一起做蛋糕，但还是很开心的事。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过……人数这么多，实在很难像平常那样着手做蛋糕。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之、总之请各位听安洁说！那边的人请坐下，啊居然弄得那么乱！？”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2631", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，在做了在做了！”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "da0050", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们也来帮忙了！都是女孩子对吧，知道你们负责体力活的人手不够啦！”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "db0031", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“叫我们做什么都可以！”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "da0051", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算你这么说～～！”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2632", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然安洁站了出来想指挥众人，不过事态逐渐演变成无法收拾的局面。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我要当负责放草莓的！我喜欢放草莓！”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "sa0041", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等一下等一下，大家请先安静下来！要先把该做的事情整理出来才行。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然我也试着和安洁一起控制场面，但是大家你一言我一语地完全没在听我们说话。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "众人的心意让我们很高兴……不过这样下去……", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是这样，爱理。”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sk1022", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“考试结束后只剩半天课也是原因之一吧……在寒假前大家都很闲。”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4114", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且现在正是喜欢热闹的年纪。”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sk1023", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么热闹，这样根本只是混乱。”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4115", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的，结女的学生太丢脸了……”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4116", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此时，濑名同学缓缓站了起来。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;“全员肃静！！！”", "text_idx": 6, "plain": "“全员肃静！！！”", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4117", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊对不起！？”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2633", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……咦、咦咦？”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2634", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在濑名同学的一吼之后，现场立刻安静了下来。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "该说不愧是校内无人不知无人不晓的优等生＆学园长之女的力量吗……", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱、爱理同学？？”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2635", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之大家先听说明！和特别课程的料理实习课时一样。”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4118", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们班上的学生，应该全员都被老师指定助手的安洁训练过了对吧？”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4119", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……啊……”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2636", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学对着还在惊讶的安洁微笑。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在这里的人，都是想要帮忙安洁才聚集而来的。”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4120", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，安洁，下指示吧。”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar4121", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是濑名同学的“帮忙”，在她的控场之下──", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2637", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你爱理同学！”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2638", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁对不起～刚才兴奋过头了～”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "sa0042", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会不会……是安洁没有好好指挥非常抱歉！”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2639", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么各位，首先请听安洁说！安洁会告诉每个人应该要负责做什么事。”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2640", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "女孩子们很快就恢复冷静，安洁也有条有理地开始说明。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──看来我还差得远呢。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为跟安洁抱持同样的心意，所以就和安洁做同样的事情是不行的。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种时候更应该分工合作。这也是“分享”的其中一个重点。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生～我们该做什么才好？”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "da0052", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就像濑名同学说的，跟特别课程的时候一样喔！”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好！帮忙是吧！”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "ht0383", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，也就是说我们负责辅佐安洁。”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2641", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么就立刻开始说明！各位男生们也请仔细听喔！”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 445, "voice": "ag2642", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“交给我们吧～”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "db0032", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
